# Restricted C atom: the aufbau over the m blocks puts both 2p
# electrons in m=-1, with the empty 2p0 below them in energy. The
# trust-region solver releases charge into m=0 and optimizes the
# occupations with the orbitals, reaching the fractional ensemble
# (4/3 and 2/3, at a common Fermi level) 4.4 mEh below.
System C.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method gga_x_pbe-gga_c_pbe
DFTGrid 75 -302
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
ConvThr 1e-7
MaxIter 60
TrustRegion true
SaveChk complex_orbs_c_pbe_tr.chk
